## Goal
Produce a PCA of the samples from the gene counts, coloured by condition, so the user can see
how the six rnaseq_bulk samples (A1-A3, B1-B3) separate in expression space and whether that
separation follows the `condition` column of the design (untreated vs treated).

## Inputs
Artifact types resolve through each sub-stage's OUTPUTS.tsv at execution time; the paths
